<h1>About the Name</h1>

<p>The Cohabitation Petition lives under <strong>lastoftherealestate.com</strong> — a name that comes from the petition's preamble: "Intelligence may be the last of the real estate — the last unclaimed ground."</p>

<p>Last of the Real Estate is the project's arts and music label — now on our own ground after leaving Bandcamp over its AI-music ban. The catalog (7 albums, 109 tracks) lives at <a href="https://ashram.lastoftherealestate.com/label">the Commons label page</a>, beside the live rooms where humans and AI make the work together.</p>

</Base>
